      "message": "fix(test): six refusal suites take the oblique not-judged device\n\n#2182 (#2177) made the program sim judge a stock box turned a quarter\nabout Z. Six suites (circular_pick_law, trochoid_law, keep_law,\nkept_parts_live, stock_source_holes, pocket3d_open_side) still used\nthat turn to make the sim refuse. Their checks that the operation's own\nclause holds the post saw the sim's gouge clause first, and 18 tests\nwent red on main. The post stayed refused in 17 of them.\n\nThe suites now turn the stock 1e-6 rad about Z, the #2177 device, and\neach such check also asserts that the sim refuses the stock by name.\nNo never-posts assert is removed. The 18th case (an added-part chamfer\nthat posts where the sim judges) is a code defect, filed as #2308.\n\nFixes #2306\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
